    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66736" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετακόσμ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόσμος</span> IV) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>between worlds</i>: Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετακόσμιον, τό</span>, <i>interspace between the worlds</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				2pp.37,38
			</span></i> U.: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				359
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.731d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				734c
			</span></i>: later as Adj., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. χώρα</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mort.</u>
				15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
			'abysmal', 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερωκεάνιος καὶ μετακόσμιος ἀσέβεια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.425
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				675
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> name of the
			twelfth <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόπος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				8(4).126
			</span></i>.</div>
